  Caption line 'அப்போது கோவையில் 2,647 குழந்தைகளுக்கு வழங்கப்பட்டது' and reel_script both omit that the 2,647 figure was the count at the Sept 28 launch, which is a date-linked fact mixed into the same sentence as the 3,380 total in the reel_script ('இதுவரை 3,380... 2,647... ' presented as sequential without clear separation)
  slides_spec 'எங்கே' slide lists 'அரசு மருத்துவமனை: 2,078' but the article attributes 2,078 to 'அரசு மருத்துவமனையில்' only in the context of the Coimbatore government hospital; the slide label drops the Coimbatore qualifier, creating ambiguity
